## Node identity and runtime flags for mcl_spartan.
-name ${MCL_NODE_NAME}@${MCL_NODE_HOST}
-setcookie ${MCL_COOKIE}

+K true

## Async thread pool. THIS SERVICE DOES REAL PORT I/O: every turn is one HTTPS
## request, and httpc runs those on this pool, so the default of 1 would
## serialize a mind's turns behind each other. `+A 8' is still an order of
## magnitude below the schedulers, which is the resource that matters here.
+A 8
